      "content": "thanks for that. when you say nigeria has more \"informal\" practices and \"inconsistent\" schedules, are u implying that it's basically harder to trust them with high-precision components compared to vietnam? just trying to be real about the operational risks—is there a tendency for things to get more unpredictable or dishonest in the nigerian market?",
